{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《</span>死有對証》劇情愈來愈激！昨晚（28日）播出一集，美寧（王菲飾）竟然向「高富帥」Michael（黃俊豪飾）獻出螢幕初吻，令正印男友高俊（馬貫東飾）慘慘豬「戴綠帽」，三角關係極度緊張，隨時引爆網民熱話！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.43.48.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gA5hY1wzJD1790654889.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.43.48.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇情講到美寧想與帥氣富有的 Michael 合資瑜伽中心，但高俊一眼睇穿對方有不良企圖。高俊踩上 Michael 公司暗中調查，Michael 竟用激將法狂寸高俊：「你知唔知你衰乜嘢？你衰無錢！」幸好高俊忍住冇中計，僅警告對方收手。豈料心機極重的 Michael 竟然自製傷勢，向美寧「屈」高俊打人兼威脅撤資，令美寧對男友徹底心死，提出分開冷靜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.43.44.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026D1t80uZLfj1790654889.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.43.44.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">美寧大受打擊，相約 Michael 飲酒大吐苦水，埋怨與高俊拍拖愈來愈攰：「依家連我識乜朋友都要管！」Michael 見機不可失，即刻趁虛而入向美寧深情表白，更主動霸王硬上弓咀嘴，成功奪取芳心。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.44.58.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026BxbsMcF9l21790654890.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.44.58.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.45.10.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026C9mwLpRMEg1790654891.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-28 下午2.45.10.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">原來這場激吻戲是王菲入行以來的「螢幕初吻」，她接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 獨家訪問時坦言初時相當緊張：「當收到劇本知道對手係 Jeremy（黃俊豪）都放心啲，因為我本身識佢冇咁緊張。同埋呢場戲喺後期先拍，我哋事前都有 Warm up，已經入咗戲。」她更大讚 Jeremy 極具風度，鏡頭後會主動溝通，令拍攝過程順利兼零尷尬。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">至於拍親熱戲有冇向真實的另一半「備案」？王菲笑言有主動申報：「佢初時以為對手係阿東（馬貫東），仲講笑話嗰晚要睇少一集！但其實佢好支持我，因為佢都做過幕前，好清楚演員要專業完成每個角色，依家佢每一集都有捧場！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T04:39:43.078015+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":638,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}